Task: extract the validation outcome.
- executed: true only if the document records an evaluation/conclusion of executed batches.
- validated: true/false as concluded by the document; null if not concluded.
- deviations_reported: true if deviations were recorded, false if the deviation section states
  none (or is struck through / "NA"), null if the document only describes the deviation process.
- concluded_by / conclusion_date: who signed the conclusion and when, as written.

